On Wed, Jun 06, 2012 at 12:28:46PM +0000, Alasdair Kergon wrote:
> Upstream source repo move to fedorahosted.org git.
 
We are taking the opportunity of the next LVM2 release to switch
from CVS to git over the next few days:
  http://git.fedorahosted.org/git/?p=LVM2.git;a=summary

The new read-only commits mailing list (replacing lvm2-cvs) is:
  https://fedorahosted.org/mailman/listinfo/lvm2-commits
archived at:
  https://fedorahosted.org/pipermail/lvm2-commits/

Commit messages will continue to be sent to lvm-devel.

We are making this change gradually over the next few days, so please
bear with us while we update web pages and documentation etc. and hold
back from asking questions about it.  No code changes of substance will
be committed until the switchover is complete.

Alasdair


